OL,3,AIsraeli strike kills senior Hamas
OL,4,Asecurity official and family in Gaza
OL,5,ACity
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Israeli air strike in the Gaza Strip
OL,8,Fhas killed a senior Hamas security
OL,9,Fofficial and three members of his
OL,10,Ffamily, according to local doctors and
OL,11,Fthe Hamas-run interior ministry.
OL,13,FMohammed Abu al-Ouf, 47, the head of
OL,14,FHamas's internal security service in
OL,15,Fnorthern Gaza, his wife and their two
OL,16,Fteenage daughters died when their
OL,17,Fapartment in Shati refugee camp in Gaza
OL,18,FCity was bombed at dawn, the ministry
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
