OL,3,AIsraeli strike kills senior Hamas
OL,4,Asecurity official and family in Gaza
OL,5,ACity
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Israeli military said Abu al-Ouf
OL,8,Fwas a "terrorist" and that he was
OL,9,Feliminated "to remove the threat he
OL,10,Fposed".
OL,12,FOn Tuesday, the overall commander of
OL,13,FHamas's internal security service was
OL,14,Famong 10 Palestinians reportedly killed
OL,15,Fin Israeli strikes.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
